<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche says expects 1997 income to rise.</title>
<headline>Roche says expects 1997 income to rise.</headline>
<dateline>BASEL, Switzerland 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roche Holding AG said it expected to boost full-year 1997 income excluding provisions linked to takeovers.</p>
<p>&quot;Roche anticipates another good result for the year,&quot; it said in a statement showing first-half sales rose 20 percent to 9.3 billion Swiss francs.</p>
<p>&quot;Before extraordinary provisions related to acquisitions, Roche expects a further increase in income,&quot; it said without elaborating.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
